# Ship policy (push only when asked)

**Do not `git push`** unless the user explicitly asks in that message.

Push to `main` deploys the docs site (CI syncs to `so://docs/`). Treat push as a live docs roll.

If unclear: **commit only**, ask before any push. Run `mkdocs build --strict` before shipping.
